  ["magicitem.trident-of-fish-command.dmg2014"]={title="Trident of Fish Command",subtitle="Item Magico - DMG - 2014",body="Pagina: 209\n\nRaridade: uncommon\n\nSintonizacao: Sim\n\nValor padrao 2024: 400 PO\n\nCrafting 2024: 200 PO / 10 dias\n\nThis trident is a magic weapon. It has 3 charges. While you carry it, you can use an action and expend 1 charge to cast dominate beast (save 15) from it on a beast that has an innate swimming speed. The trident regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn."},
  ["magicitem.trident-of-fish-command.xdmg2024"]={title="Trident of Fish Command",subtitle="Item Magico - XDMG - 2024",body="Pagina: 317\n\nRaridade: uncommon\n\nSintonizacao: Sim\n\nValor padrao 2024: 400 PO\n\nCrafting 2024: 200 PO / 10 dias\n\nThis magic weapon has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While you carry it, you can expend 1 charge to cast XPHB (save 15) from it on a Beast that has a XPHB."},
  ["creature.tridrone.mm2014"]={title="Tridrone",subtitle="Criatura - MM - 2014",body="Pagina: 225\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: construct / M\n\nCR: 1/2\n\nCA: 15\n\nPV: 16 (3d8 + 3)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 12 | DEX 13 | CON 12 | INT 9 | WIS 10 | CHA 9\n\nSentidos: truesight 120 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Modron\n\n=== TRACOS ===\n\nAxiomatic Mind\n\nThe tridrone can't be compelled to act in a manner contrary to its nature or its instructions.\n\nDisintegration\n\nIf the tridrone dies, its body disintegrates into dust, leaving behind its weapons and anything else it was carrying.\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nThe tridrone makes three fist attacks or three javelin attacks.\n\nFist\n\nmw 3 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h3 (1d4 + 1) bludgeoning damage.\n\nJavelin\n\nmw,rw 3 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft., one target. h4 (1d6 + 1) piercing damage."},
